{"ticker":"CONCORDBIO","symbol":"CONCORDBIO","instrumentId":3187151,"name":"Concord Biotech","industry":"NSE-Medical-Biomed/Biotech","about":"Concord Biotech Limited specializes in manufacturing Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients (APIs) and finished formulations through fermentation and semi-synthetic processes. The company operates two API units and one formulation unit near Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India.\n\nTheir Dholka facility produces various APIs, and their Limbasi facility, offers advanced capabilities for fermentation and downstream processing. The Valthera facility, focused on formulations, produces oral solids and liquids, with plans to expand into injectable lines.\n\nConcord's global presence spans over 70 countries, including significant markets like the USA, Europe, Japan, and India, partnering with leading pharmaceutical companies for API and formulation development.","website":"www.concordbiotech.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:13:41.883Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":556.4,"changePct":-0.8199643493761181,"week52High":793.75,"week52Low":507.4},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹11,642 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,170 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"117,169,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"145"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"19,069,816"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.36%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"5.77"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.07"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.99"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"2%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"41.65"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"35–84"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"12.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"12.76"},{"label":"Volume","value":"124,843"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"316,918"},{"label":"Master score","value":"45"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"66"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"27"},{"la